{
  "_comment": "Step-based bundle for the Surrender script: script metadata, the MAIN step graph under 'steps', LINKS to every reachable callable flow under 'flows', and ONLY the library units the main steps use under 'units'. Callable flows (callable flows) are NOT inlined here - 'flows' holds only { ref, version } links (the full closure, including nested flows). Each flow is fetched by its own REST call, all in parallel at session start (alongside this bundle and the checks prefetch): the engine calls GET /scripts/flow/{ref}?version=N once per link and caches the result for the session, so entering a callFlow step never blocks. A fetched flow is SELF-CONTAINED - it carries its own 'units' (the units ITS steps reference), so it needs nothing from this bundle's 'units'. Flow definitions live one-file-per-callable flow under Flows/<flowId>.v<version>.json - each file is exactly what GET /scripts/flow/{id}?version=N returns, so a distinct REST call fetches each flow. A callable flow is just a script with is_callable='Y' (what used to be a 'sub-flow'); another top-level script called as a flow is linked the same way, keyed by script id. The old node[]/edges[] graph is retired (see README 21.6): steps are the containers, content items reference units by plain 'ref' (this frozen document inlines the exact unit under that key, so it resolves within the same file; the authoring-time library pin 'refVersion' is baked in at publish and not carried here), onEnter runs checks/waypoints, and buttons own navigation via 'routes'. Route 'to' targets: a stepId (same flow), '@exit:<name>' (return to a flow's caller), or '@end' (end the call). Routes may carry 'onEnter' actions (fired when the route is taken). Flows are invoked by callFlow:{ ref, args? } steps; a terminal flow finishes the call itself, a non-terminal one returns through a named exit mapped by the caller's onExit. Placeholder-driven prompts and check outcomes resolve at runtime from the prefetch results map (see surrender-001.checks.example.json) or a live check call.",
  "classifier1": "life",
  "classifier2": "surrender",
  "scriptId": "surrender-001",
  "version": 3,
  "isPrimary": true,
  "title": "Surrender Request",
  "libraryVersion": "2026-09-01",
  "startStepId": "st-suspended",
  "steps": [
    {
      "stepId": "st-suspended",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Suspended funds check",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.suspended-fund"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "auto",
          "kind": "auto",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "chk.suspended-fund == 'Yes'",
              "to": "st-suspended-info"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-alternatives"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-suspended-info",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Suspended funds",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-susp",
          "ref": "prm.suspended-fund"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "end",
          "kind": "end",
          "label": "End call",
          "onClick": ["act.log-task-suspended-reqs"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-alternatives",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Alternatives",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.allow-alternatives"
        }
      ],
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-alt-intro",
          "ref": "prm.alternatives-intro",
          "visibleWhen": "chk.allow-alternatives == 'Yes'"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-alt-q",
          "ref": "qst.interested-in-alternatives",
          "visibleWhen": "chk.allow-alternatives == 'Yes'"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "chk.allow-alternatives == 'No' || c-alt-q.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "chk.allow-alternatives == 'No'",
              "to": "st-value"
            },
            {
              "when": "c-alt-q.value == 'part-surrender'",
              "to": "st-partial"
            },
            {
              "when": "c-alt-q.value == 'pup-ph'",
              "to": "st-pup"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-value"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-partial",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Partial surrender form",
      "callFlow": {
        "ref": "partial-surrender-form"
      }
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-pup",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Paid-up / premium holiday info",
      "callFlow": {
        "ref": "pup-ph-info"
      }
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-value",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Policy value & warnings",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.policy-value"
        },
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.policy-features"
        }
      ],
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-value",
          "ref": "prm.value-today"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-warn",
          "ref": "prm.warnings-conditional",
          "visibleWhen": "chk.policy-features.anyWarning == true"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-continue",
          "ref": "qst.continue-or-think",
          "visibleWhen": "chk.policy-features.anyWarning == true"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "chk.policy-features.anyWarning == false || c-continue.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-continue.value == 'think'",
              "to": "st-signpost-moneyhelper"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-hold"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-hold",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Please hold",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-hold",
          "ref": "prm.pop-on-hold"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "routes": [
            {
              "to": "st-pre-decision"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-pre-decision",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Pre-surrender eligibility",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.pre-surrender-flags"
        },
        {
          "kind": "waypoint",
          "id": "wp-pre",
          "aggregate": "all-pass",
          "source": "chk.pre-surrender-flags"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "auto",
          "kind": "auto",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "wp-pre == 'fail'",
              "to": "st-fail-form"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-trust-decision"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-trust-decision",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Trust / assignment / bankruptcy",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.trust-assigned-bankruptcy"
        },
        {
          "kind": "waypoint",
          "id": "wp-trust",
          "aggregate": "tri-state",
          "source": "chk.trust-assigned-bankruptcy"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "auto",
          "kind": "auto",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "wp-trust == 'fail'",
              "to": "st-fail-form"
            },
            {
              "when": "wp-trust == 'amber'",
              "to": "st-trust-manual"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-trust-confirm"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-trust-manual",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Trust / assignment (manual check)",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-trust-manual",
          "ref": "chk.trust-assigned-manual"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "c-trust-manual.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-trust-manual.value == 'Yes'",
              "to": "st-fail-form"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-trust-confirm"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-trust-confirm",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Confirm trust / assignment / bankruptcy",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-confirm",
          "ref": "qst.confirm-trust-assignment"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "c-confirm.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-confirm.value == 'confirms-issue'",
              "to": "st-fail-form"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-method"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-method",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Preferred method",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-third-party",
          "ref": "prm.third-party-claim"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-method-intro",
          "ref": "prm.fastest-over-phone"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-which-method",
          "ref": "qst.which-method"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "enabledWhen": "c-which-method.answered",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "c-which-method.value == 'online'",
              "to": "st-website-warn"
            },
            {
              "when": "c-which-method.value == 'phone'",
              "to": "st-ownership-decision"
            },
            {
              "when": "c-which-method.value == 'paper'",
              "to": "st-paper-form"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-website-warn",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Website warnings",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "c-website",
          "ref": "prm.website-link-warnings"
        }
      ],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "back",
          "kind": "back",
          "label": "Back"
        },
        {
          "key": "next",
          "kind": "next",
          "label": "Next",
          "routes": [
            {
              "to": "st-scam"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stepId": "st-ownership-decision",
      "version": 1,
      "title": "Ownership",
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "ref": "chk.single-joint-ownership"
        },
        {
          "kind": "waypoint",
          "id": "wp-own",
          "aggregate": "single-joint",
          "source": "chk.single-joint-ownership"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "buttons": [
        {
          "key": "auto",
          "kind": "auto",
          "routes": [
            {
              "when": "wp-own == 'amber'",
              "to": "st-other-ph"
            },
            {
              "to": "st-can-phone"
            }
